<view class="page">
  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-title">家庭成员</view>
    <view class="muted">第一次使用先选择“我是谁”，会保存在本机；所有成员都能确认菜单。</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:for="{{members}}" wx:key="id" class="member-card card {{currentMember.id === item.id ? 'active-card' : ''}}" bindtap="chooseMember" data-id="{{item.id}}">
    <view>
      <view class="member-name">{{item.name}}</view>
      <view class="muted">可点菜，也可确认今日菜单</view>
    </view>
    <view class="current {{currentMember.id === item.id ? 'active' : ''}}">
      {{currentMember.id === item.id ? '当前' : '切换'}}
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section card guide">
    <view class="guide-title">当前内测版</view>
    <view class="guide-line">1. 第一次选择“我是谁”</view>
    <view class="guide-line">2. 点菜、菜单、买菜清单云同步</view>
    <view class="guide-line">3. 所有人都能确认今日菜单</view>
    <view class="guide-line">4. 先用体验版给家人测试</view>
    <button class="button-primary reset-button" bindtap="resetDefaults" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">刷新默认菜品</button>
  </view>
</view>
